     "big": "<span data-latex=\"=b\" data-type=\"inline-math\"></span>",
     "title": "Тотожність",
     "formula": "",
     "text": "<span data-latex=\"a^{\\operatorname{log}_{a} b} = b\" data-type=\"inline-math\"></span>. Наприклад, <span data-latex=\"7^{\\operatorname{log}_{7} 12} = 12\" data-type=\"inline-math\"></span>."
